sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant U as Conditional U-Net
    participant L as Latent State
    participant V as VAE Decoder
    participant O as Image
    S->>L: 初始化 x_T
    loop t = T ... 1
        L->>U: x_t, t, text context
        U-->>S: predicted noise
        S->>L: step() 得到 x_(t-1)
    end
    L->>V: 最终 x_0 latent
    V-->>O: 解码为图像
